<title>AUSTRIA: VA Stahl H1 group EBIT down 29 pct. [CORRECTED 06:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>VA Stahl H1 group EBIT down 29 pct. [CORRECTED 06:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects EBIT percentage change from 31 pct to 29 pct in headline and story.)</p>
<p>Austrian steelmaker VA Stahl said on Friday group earnings before interest and tax (EBIT) fell 29 percent in the first six months to 1.05 billion schillings while pre-tax profit fell 31 percent.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit for the first half reached 1.33 billion schillings against 1.941 billion in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
